herolte: read-only PSCI probe (0437)

TWRP idles its cores with PSCI CPU_SUSPEND (param 0x10000, cpu-sleep: 560 s against 5 s of WFI, E-0288). Before writing anything for deep idle: 30 s after the power thread starts, HEROLTE PSCI lines: PSCI_VERSION, PSCI_FEATURES of CPU_SUSPEND, CPU_OFF, SYSTEM_SUSPEND and SYSTEM_OFF, and AFFINITY_INFO of the eight cores (0 ON, 1 OFF, 2 ON_PENDING). SMC reads only.

